= Template:Infobox Project =

== Purpose ==
Display project information with lifecycle tracking and SMW property generation.

== Parameters ==

{| class="wikitable"
! Parameter !! Type !! Required !! Description
|-
| name || string || Yes || Display name of project
| description || string || Yes || Core description text
| status || enum || Yes || Proposed, Planning, Active, On Hold, Completed, Cancelled
| lead || string || No || Project lead person/entity
| domain || string || No || Subject domain
| start_date || string || No || Project start date
| end_date || string || No || Project end date (if completed)
| deliverables || string || No || Comma-separated list of deliverables
| related_projects || string || No || Comma-separated list of related projects
|}

== Examples ==

=== Basic Usage ===
<pre>
{{Infobox Project
|name=BITWIKI Migration
|description=Migrate content to MediaWiki/SMW
|status=Active
|lead=BITCORE
}}
</pre>

